# This repository formats with Biome, not Prettier.
#
# Nothing here is Prettier-formatted, and `biome.json` sets a 120-column width
# while `packages/pi-subagents` disables the formatter outright. An editor or
# hook that runs Prettier on save would reflow whole files and bury real
# changes in reformatting noise, so opt every path out.
#
# Formatting entry points: `bun run format` (root) or `bun run format` inside
# a package.
*
